# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# claude-afk .gitignore
#
# This project talks to the Telegram Bot API, so the first job of this file is
# to make it impossible to commit a bot token or a chat id. Runtime state lives
# in ~/.claude/afk/ (outside the repo) by design — the patterns below are the
# belt to that suspenders.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Secrets and runtime state — never commit ---
config.json
afk_config.json
active.json
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets/
afk-home/

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
env/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- Editors / OS ---
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# --- Local scratch ---
/tmp/
/scratch/
/CLAUDE.md
